@startuml UC10_Rate_Forecast_Activity_Diagram

title UC10: Rate Forecast - Activity Diagram

start
:User selects "Rate This Forecast" option;

if (User previously rated this forecast?) then (yes)
  :System displays rating interface
  with existing rating;
else (no)
  :System displays rating interface (1-5 scale);
endif

:User selects rating value (1-5);

if (User wants to add comments?) then (yes)
  :User adds comments;
endif

:User submits rating;
:System validates rating;
:System stores rating with associated
forecast, service, and city;
:System updates aggregate rating for the service;
:System displays confirmation message;

stop

@enduml
